,14:fixes/g12/v_mv,9:fixes-g12,14:run v_mv.tally,1783:10:v_mv.tally,1763:model steps
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's carried item 6 (issue #108, invented): #97's N4, pos(k + n) on an integer index, and N7, the calendar built-ins and explain over a movement"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index ks = 1..4

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input holidays: calendar

input last_k: int

input n_add: int

input n_last: int

input pay_day: date

input windowed: calendar

def nxt[k in ks]: int = pos(k + 1)

def nxt_guarded[k in ks]: int = if k < last_k then pos(k + 1) else pos(k)

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee

ask n4_inside: nxt[2]

ask n4_past: nxt[4]

ask n4_guard: nxt_guarded[k] for k in ks

ask n7_weekday: weekday(2026-06-01), weekday(2026-06-07)

ask n7_last_business: last_business(2026-06, n_last - 1, holidays), last_business(2026-05, n_last, holidays)

ask n7_window_agrees: add_business(2026-06-01, n_add, windowed)

ask n7_window_differs: add_business(2026-06-19, n_add, windowed)

ask n7_explain_before: explain bal(konto, 2026-06-09)

ask n7_explain_after: explain bal(konto, 2026-06-30)

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = 40.00 PLN "the card"
  holidays = calendar(weekends [sat, sun]) assumed "the card names no holiday" "the card"
  last_k = 4 "the card"
  n_add = 3 "the card"
  n_last = 2 "the card"
  pay_day = 2026-06-10 "the card"
  windowed = calendar(weekends [sat, sun], added [window(2026-06-22, 2026-06-26)]) "the card: one more holiday in the week of 22 June, its day not yet fixed"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"

ask e_pay: explain pay
,,1:0,1493:e_pay: pay
  plan, day 2026-06-10, booking cut 2026-06-10, status past
  leg cash from konto to world amount 40.00 PLN
  derivation at 2026-06-10:
    [1] row card_2026:pay_day = 2026-06-10
        version card_2026, source card, "T's card (invented)", locator "the card", governs always, known 2026-01-01
    [2] row card_2026:fee = 40.00 PLN
        version card_2026, source card, "T's card (invented)", locator "the card", governs always, known 2026-01-01
  cut 2026-10-01
n4_guard (k = 1): 2
  cut 2026-10-01
n4_guard (k = 2): 3
  cut 2026-10-01
n4_guard (k = 3): 4
  cut 2026-10-01
n4_guard (k = 4): 4
  cut 2026-10-01
n4_inside: 3
  cut 2026-10-01
n4_past: refused: RUN-KEY 5 is outside ks
  cut 2026-10-01
n7_explain_after: 460.00 PLN
  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-06-30
  from: opening card_2026:opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN, 2026-01-01 start (version card_2026, source card, locator "the card")
  2026-06-10:
    pay.cash (past): -40.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay
  cut 2026-10-01
n7_explain_before: 500.00 PLN
  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-06-09
  from: opening card_2026:opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN, 2026-01-01 start (version card_2026, source card, locator "the card")
  no movement
  cut 2026-10-01
n7_last_business: (2026-06-30, 2026-05-28)
  assumed: the card names no holiday (holidays)
  cut 2026-10-01
n7_weekday: (1, 7)
  cut 2026-10-01
n7_window_agrees: 2026-06-04
  cut 2026-10-01
n7_window_differs: window(2026-06-24, 2026-06-25)
  cut 2026-10-01
,15:fixes/g12/v_mvq,9:fixes-g12,15:run v_mvq.tally,8187:11:v_mvq.tally,8166:model g10_ledger
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, issue #41, G10: stated readings and the residual ledger (L §5.19, E §6.1–§6.3): konto padded from buffer up, by nothing and down, a later version restating the middle reading, read before and after it is known; buffer padded from konto at the instant of konto's last pad, so the readings' rank on that day decides what each sees; save anchored; matched lines, a certain instance observed short, uncertain ones partly and fully fulfilled, expected but missing ones, twelve of one move on one day ordered by the movement order, an observation paid a month early, one that fulfils nothing, two whose links are refused, one beside an instance of its move that exists, decisions on covered days in the span and after it; on k4, instances whose day is a hole, matched and missing; on k5, two moves whose amounts are holes, their questions sorting against their names."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind maybe: transfers uncertain

index month = month 2026-01..2026-02

index tips = [t01, t02, t03, t04, t05, t06, t07, t08, t09, t10, t11, t12]

index ab = [a, b]

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place buffer: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place save: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place k4: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place k5: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place shop: outside lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input bank: observed

input rent_amt: money PLN

input rent_dom: int

input fee_day: date

input fee_amt: money PLN

input part_day: date

input part_amt: money PLN

input prom_day: date

input prom_amt: money PLN

input prom2_day: date

input prom2_amt: money PLN

input flag: bool

input flag_day: date

input flag_amt: money PLN

input flag2[m in month]: bool

input flag2_dom: int

input tip_day: date

input tip_amt: money PLN

input sweep_dom: int

input small: money PLN

input big: money PLN

input odd_day[k in ab]: date question "When does the odd payment go out?"

input odd_amt: money PLN

input odd2_day: date question "When does the second odd payment go out?"

input odd2_amt: money PLN

input odd0_day: date question "When does nothing go out?"

input hz_day: date

input hz_amt: money PLN question "Aa: how much is the first repair?"

input ha_day: date

input ha_amt: money PLN question "Zz: how much is the second repair?"

move rent[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, rent_dom)
  leg cash from konto to shop amount rent_amt

move fee: transfers
  on fee_day
  leg cash from konto to shop amount fee_amt

move short: transfers
  on part_day
  leg cash from konto to shop amount part_amt

move promise: maybe
  on prom_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount prom_amt

move promise2: maybe
  on prom2_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount prom2_amt

move flagged: transfers
  on flag_day
  when flag
  leg cash from konto to shop amount flag_amt

move flagged2[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, flag2_dom)
  when flag2[m]
  leg cash from konto to shop amount flag_amt

move tip[t in tips]: transfers
  on tip_day
  leg cash from konto to shop amount tip_amt

move sweep[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, sweep_dom)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to save amount if bal(konto) > 0 then small else big

move odd[k in ab]: transfers
  on odd_day[k]
  leg cash from k4 to shop amount odd_amt

move odd2: transfers
  on odd2_day
  leg cash from k4 to shop amount odd2_amt

move odd0: transfers
  on odd0_day
  leg cash from k4 to shop amount 0

move hz: transfers
  on hz_day
  leg cash from k5 to shop amount hz_amt

move ha: transfers
  on ha_day
  leg cash from k5 to shop amount ha_amt

