            version probe_v, source lease, "SCEN-03 card: Halina's rent, 2 000.00 a month in 2025, raised each January by the previous year's price-index change, rounded half up to 0.01", governs always, known 2025-01-01
  reading: reading = rb
  cut 2026-10-25
